<dialog class="mc mc--lab" data-lab-dialog="posters" aria-labelledby="lab-posters-title">
  <div class="mc__bar">
    <h2 id="lab-posters-title" class="mc__title">Poster wall</h2>
    <button type="button" class="mc__close" data-mc-close aria-label="Close the poster wall">✕</button>
  </div>

  <!-- Horizontal Tab Strip -->
  <ol class="clean lab-tabs" aria-label="Research posters, newest first">
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="lab-tab" data-poster-for="p-aeroscan" aria-pressed="true">
        <span class="lab-tab__year">2026</span>
        <span class="lab-tab__title">AeroScan Tactical Edge AI</span>
      </button>
    </li>
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="lab-tab" data-poster-for="p-thesis-spam" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="lab-tab__year">2026</span>
        <span class="lab-tab__title">YouTube Spam Detection (99.56%)</span>
      </button>
    </li>
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="lab-tab" data-poster-for="p-omr-grader" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="lab-tab__year">2025</span>
        <span class="lab-tab__title">Automated OMR Grader</span>
      </button>
    </li>
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="lab-tab" data-poster-for="p-inceptionv3" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="lab-tab__year">2024</span>
        <span class="lab-tab__title">InceptionV3 Deep Transfer</span>
      </button>
    </li>
    <li>
      <button type="button" class="lab-tab" data-poster-for="p-foodlink" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="lab-tab__year">2026</span>
        <span class="lab-tab__title">FoodLink Cloud-Native</span>
      </button>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="mc__body">
    <!-- Poster 1: AeroScan -->
    <article class="poster" id="p-aeroscan" data-poster-panel="p-aeroscan" aria-label="Poster: AeroScan: Real-Time Military Aircraft Detection & Tactical Edge AI">
      <header class="poster__head">
        <div class="poster__id">
          <h3 class="poster__title">AeroScan: Real-Time Military Aircraft Detection &amp; Tactical Edge AI</h3>
          <p class="poster__sub">Personal R&amp;D · Oct 2026 – Present</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="poster__cols">
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Abstract</h4>
          <p>
            Can custom YOLOv11s models and NVIDIA TensorRT 10 FP16 compilation achieve sub-2ms multi-camera aerial reconnaissance directly on consumer and edge GPUs?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Findings</h4>
          <ul class="poster__list">
            <li>Trained custom YOLOv11s across 8,400+ curated satellite and aerial images covering 15 military combat aircraft classes (B-2, B-52, F-16, F-22, F-35, Su-57, etc.).</li>
            <li>Compiled model with NVIDIA TensorRT 10 FP16 engine via ONNX, cutting inference latency to ~1.8 ms/frame (&gt;500 FPS throughput) on an RTX 4060.</li>
            <li>Built interactive Streamlit + OpenCV Command &amp; Control console with live webcam/RTSP stream ingestion, confidence thresholding, and audit logging.</li>
            <li>Achieved up to 87.9% mAP@50 (B-52 airframe) with robust multi-scale feature pyramids.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="brief__label">Implications</h4>
        <p>
          Enables localized tactical aerial tracking without cloud dependency, remaining operational in electronic-warfare RF-denied environments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="brief__label">How it runs</h4>
        <figure class="flow" aria-label="How AeroScan Tactical Edge AI runs, step by step">
          <figcaption class="flow__bar">
            <span class="flow__name">AEROSCAN_PIPELINE.EXE</span>
            <span class="flow__lights" aria-hidden="true">
              <i></i><i></i><i></i>
            </span>
          </figcaption>
          <ol class="flow__stages">
            <li class="flow__step">
              <div class="flow__stage">
                <span class="flow__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                <div class="flow__text">
                  <p class="flow__label">Video Ingestion</p>
                  <p class="flow__detail">Multi-camera RTSP/webcam video feed capture and frame buffering in OpenCV.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flow__step">
              <div class="flow__stage">
                <span class="flow__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                <div class="flow__text">
                  <p class="flow__label">TensorRT FP16 Acceleration</p>
                  <p class="flow__detail">FP16 CUDA engine optimization slashing inference to ~1.8ms per frame (&gt;500 FPS).</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flow__step">
              <div class="flow__stage">
                <span class="flow__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                <div class="flow__text">
                  <p class="flow__label">YOLOv11s Tactical Inference</p>
                  <p class="flow__detail">Multi-scale feature pyramid classifying 15 military aircraft airframes.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flow__step">
              <div class="flow__stage">
                <span class="flow__num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
                <div class="flow__text">
                  <p class="flow__label">Bounding Box &amp; Confidence Tracking</p>
                  <p class="flow__detail">NMS suppression and spatial coordinate alignment across sequential video frames.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="flow__loop">
                <span aria-hidden="true">↺ </span>Confidence &lt; 0.70 → Multi-frame temporal smoothing
              </p>
              <span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flow__step">
              <div class="flow__stage">
                <span class="flow__num" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
                <div class="flow__text">
                  <p class="flow__label">Streamlit C2 Telemetry</p>
                  <p class="flow__detail">Real-time Command &amp; Control dashboard with CSV event auditing and detection overlays.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </figure>
      </div>

