    <!-- Poster 4: InceptionV3 Transfer Learning -->
    <article class="poster" id="p-inceptionv3" data-poster-panel="p-inceptionv3" hidden aria-label="Poster: Deep Learning Image Classification with InceptionV3">
      <header class="poster__head">
        <div class="poster__id">
          <h3 class="poster__title">Deep Learning Image Classification with InceptionV3</h3>
          <p class="poster__sub">Deep Learning &amp; Transfer Learning Study · Mar 2024 – June 2025</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="poster__cols">
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Abstract</h4>
          <p>
            How effectively does deep transfer learning with InceptionV3 bottleneck feature extraction generalize to domain-specific multi-class visual recognition under constrained compute?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Findings</h4>
          <ul class="poster__list">
            <li>Evaluated transfer learning and progressive layer unfreezing using InceptionV3 pre-trained on ImageNet.</li>
            <li>Designed comprehensive data augmentation pipelines (affine rotation, shear, zooming, brightness jittering) to prevent overfitting on small target datasets.</li>
            <li>Systematic evaluation through loss convergence plots, confusion matrices, and per-class precision/recall curves.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="brief__label">Implications</h4>
        <p>
          Validates lightweight fine-tuning strategies for deploying deep convolutional networks on edge workstations.
        </p>
      </div>

