      <header class="poster__head">
        <div class="poster__id">
          <h3 class="poster__title">FoodLink: Cloud-Native Food Surplus Rescue Platform</h3>
          <p class="poster__sub">IDEA FEST 3 National Bronze Medalist · Mar 2025 – Present</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="poster__cols">
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Abstract</h4>
          <p>
            Which transactional outbox pattern and spatial index architecture guarantees zero-overselling and real-time proximity routing for high-concurrency food rescue?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="brief__label">Findings</h4>
          <ul class="poster__list">
            <li>Implemented Transactional Outbox pattern with Apache Kafka and 3 fan-out consumers to guarantee atomic database updates and event publishing.</li>
            <li>PostgreSQL 16 row-level locking (FOR UPDATE) and Redis 7 Lua distributed mutexes eliminated race conditions during simultaneous surplus reservation claims.</li>
            <li>PostGIS GIST spatial indexing enabled sub-5ms proximity radius queries with privacy coordinate fuzzing and QR/PIN verification handover.</li>
            <li>Deployed on Kubernetes with RollingUpdate strategies, Horizontal Pod Autoscalers (HPA), and GitLab CI/CD with 100% test pass rate.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="brief__label">Implications</h4>
        <p>
